<title>CANADA: Rogers Cantel to hold news conference.</title>
<headline>Rogers Cantel to hold news conference.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rogers Cantel Mobile Communications Inc said on Wednesday it would hold a major news conference today at 1000 EST/1500 GMT in Toronto.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
